        "created_at": "2016-03-16T15:02:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It's been a while, so bear with us...</p><p>What are the strategic benefits of a ship teleporting out once they engage an Opp ship? Buying desired things in one Sector, and then zipping out to fight an Opp ship in another Sector, obviously. In general, though, what else...?</p><p>They can engage a ship in the new Sector, right?</p>",
